title: "Cycle-life dataset and analysis code for aqueous Zn/MnO2 coin cells"
abstract: "Per-cycle cycling data of 33 Zn/MnO2 CR2032 coin cells cycled at 25 ± 2 °C between 0.8 and 1.8 V, with the code that builds the labels, the features, the leave-one-cell-out evaluation and the conformal intervals."
